        <Literal>Grain boundaries</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706012"/>
        <Literal>grain boundary segregation</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706013"/>
        <Literal>First-principles calculations</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706014"/>
        <Literal>MolecularStatics</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706015"/>
        <Literal>DensityFunctionalTheory</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706016"/>
        <Literal>MolecularDynamics</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706017"/>
        <Literal>Symmetric and asymmetric tilt grain boundary structures and energies in Al and Cu. Structures relaxed with two-pass CG minimisation in LAMMPS; GB-normal stress reduced to zero (box/relax).</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706018"/>
        <Literal>High-throughput DFT (VASP/PBE) study of elemental segregation energies and cohesion at six ferritic-iron grain boundaries. Covers the majority of the periodic table.</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706019"/>
        <Literal>DFT and classical atomistic data for Î£5 [001] tilt grain boundaries (Î£5{210} and Î£10{310}) in refractory bcc metals W and Mo. Explores quasi-aperiodic grain boundary phases.</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/17748640770602"/>
        <Literal>FeGB_PtableSeg_FromFirstPrinciples_Data</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706020"/>
        <Literal>Grain boundary structures and energies computed with MACE (universal ML interatomic potential) for a wide range of materials (bcc, fcc, diamond, graphene). Associated with a score-based denoising ML model for grain boundary prediction.</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706021"/>
        <Literal>Grain boundary structures (multiple GB phases: domino, pearl, variants) and energies for Î£7, Î£13b, Î£19b, Î£37c, Î£49 [111] symmetric tilt boundaries in seven fcc metals. Computed with molecular statics and eight (M)EAM potentials.</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706022"/>
        <Literal>Grain boundary structures and free energies for six Î£3 [111] phases in aluminium (B1, B2, deformed-square, faceted, square at {011}; zipper at {112}). Nine Al EAM/MEAM potentials used. Supports a grain boundary faceting phase transition study.</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
    <DataPropertyAssertion>
        <DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="ontology:NFDI_0001007"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/177486407706023"/>
        <Literal>Comprehensive DFT (VASP/GGA-PBE) grain boundary database covering grain boundary energies, work of separation, and atomic structures for a wide range of elemental metals. Part of the Materials Project.</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
