    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0001933</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>This term is currently a descendant of &apos;information content entity&apos;, which requires that it &apos;is about&apos; something. A value specification of &apos;20g&apos; for a measurement data item of the mass of a particular mouse &apos;is about&apos; the mass of that mouse. However there are cases where a value specification is not clearly about any particular. In the future we may change &apos;value specification&apos; to remove the &apos;is about&apos; requirement.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OBI_0001933</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>value specification</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000115"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OMO_0001000</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">The term was added to the ontology on the assumption it was in scope, but it turned out later that it was not.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000116"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OMO_0001000</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">This obsolesence reason should be used conservatively. Typical valid examples are: un-necessary grouping classes in disease ontologies, a phenotype term added on the assumption it was a disease.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OMO_0001000</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>out of scope</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000112"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OMO_0002000</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>&apos;part disjoint with&apos; &apos;defined by construct&apos; &quot;&quot;&quot;
    PREFIX owl: &lt;http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#&gt;
    PREFIX : &lt;http://example.org/
    CONSTRUCT {
      [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty :part_of ;
        owl:someValuesFrom ?a ;
        owl:disjointWith [
          a owl:Restriction ;
          owl:onProperty :part_of ;
          owl:someValuesFrom ?b
        ]
      ]
    }
    WHERE {
      ?a :part_disjoint_with ?b .
    }</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000115"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OMO_0002000</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Links an annotation property to a SPARQL CONSTRUCT query which is meant to provide semantics for a shortcut relation.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:OMO_0002000</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>defined by construct</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000112"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:RO_0000052</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">this fragility is a characteristic of this vase</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000112"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:RO_0000052</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">this red color is a characteristic of this apple</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="obo:IAO_0000115"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:RO_0000052</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">a relation between a specifically dependent continuant (the characteristic) and any other entity (the bearer), in which the characteristic depends on the bearer for its existence.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>obo:RO_0000052</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">characteristic of</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
