        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:comment"/>
        <AbbreviatedIRI>mwo:MWO_0001000</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>An event that involves a focused exchange of knowledge, opinions, and insights among specialists in a particular field to address complex topics, evaluate research findings, or explore emerging trends.</Literal>
