        <AbbreviatedIRI>mwo:MWO_0001099</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>Material designation is an identifier assigned to a material to specify its name, Id, classification, composition, or standardized reference in scientific, engineering, or industrial contexts.</Literal>
