        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528331</IRI>
        <Literal>The NPO is developed to represent the knowledge underlying the description, preparation, and characterization of nanomaterials in cancer nanotechnology research.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528332</IRI>
        <Literal>MAMBO (Materials And Molecules Basic Ontology) is a domain ontology for molecular materials.</Literal>
