        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528369</IRI>
        <Literal>model the most tangible aspect of research in computing disciplines Ã¢â¬â the research artifacts</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/17453302652837</IRI>
        <Literal>The ColabFit Project collabration aims to create a framework to facilitate the Training Service and use of machine learning (ML) models in materials science including interatomic potentials. This includes an online exchange for datasets used to train ML models and a portable format for deploying ML models to simulation platforms using the OpenKIM system.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528370</IRI>
        <Literal>represent the context of energy system analysis based on standard terminologies used by human experts in this field of research</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528371</IRI>
        <Literal>An ontology of phenotypic qualities (properties, attributes or characteristics).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528372</IRI>
        <Literal>models concepts and relations important to scientific research</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528373</IRI>
        <Literal>conceptual model for Quantities, Units, Dimensions, Values (QUDV) to     define systems of units and quantities for use in system models</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528374</IRI>
        <Literal>a resource for annotating biomedical investigations, including the study design, protocols and instrumentation used, the data generated and the types of analysis performed on the data.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528375</IRI>
        <Literal>define the base classes properties, and restrictions used for modeling     physical quantities, units of measure, and their dimensions in various     measurement systems</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528376</IRI>
        <Literal>describe workflow</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528377</IRI>
        <Literal>enable interoperability between solutions from different providers and among various activity sectors in the Internet of Things (IoT), thus contributing to the development of the Global digital market</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528378</IRI>
        <Literal>workflow metadata standard</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528379</IRI>
        <Literal>characterize services, models, and interactions between users</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/17453302652838</IRI>
        <Literal>JSON schemas and examples representing structural data, characteristic properties, modeling workflows and related data about materials standardizing the diverse landscape of information</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528380</IRI>
        <Literal>defines the main concepts of building material, types, layers, and properties</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/174533026528381</IRI>
        <Literal>Brinell Hardness method modelling</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
