        <Literal>Materials Data Science(MDS) is an ontology encompassing multiple domains relevant to materials science, chemical synthesis and characterizations, photovoltaics and geospatial datasets. The terms used for classes, subclasses and instances are mapped to PMDCo and BFO Ontologies.</Literal>
