        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/17454178818931</IRI>
        <Literal>24 Project collabrations in CRC/TRR103, 10 of them on âMachine-Learning and Material Informaticsâ</Literal>
