        <IRI>https://nfdi.fiz-karlsruhe.de/matwerk/msekg/17454179701921</IRI>
        <Literal>Focus on alloy design and performance improvement of Ni-based superalloys and Co-based single crystal super alloys with gamma / gamma prime microstructures. Improving processing technology. Obtain knowledge of materials properties and microstructure by implementing new test procedures of mechanical properties and characterization. Scalebridging materials modeling.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
