        <AbbreviatedIRI>ontology:NFDI_0001022</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">A namespace refers to a distinct, unique identifier that is used to distinguish concepts and entities within an ontology from those in other ontologies or systems. It&apos;s typically represented as a URL or URI (Uniform Resource Identifier) and ensures that each element within the ontology has a globally unique reference.</Literal>
