        <AbbreviatedIRI>ontology:NFDI_0001104</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>A Conference Abstract is a brief summary of research findings or scholarly work submitted for presentation at an academic or professional conference, often serving as a precursor to a full paper or presentation.</Literal>
