        <AbbreviatedIRI>ontology:NFDI_0001105</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>A Conference Paper is a scholarly publication that presents research findings at an academic or professional conference, typically published in conference proceedings.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
