        <AbbreviatedIRI>ontology:NFDI_0001207</AbbreviatedIRI>
        <Literal>A Presentation Document is a document that consists of structured visual and textual content designed for conveying information to an audience, typically used in meetings, conferences, and educational settings.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
