        <IRI>https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0020131</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">An intensive quality is a qualty that inheres in only portion of matter and thus is independent of the bearers (system-) size.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
